        "collapsed_TnJHpV": {
          "type": "collapsed",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Benefits",
            "heading_mobile": "",
            "text": "<p>Healthy skin starts in the shower – we're tackling skin issues at the source. The Qure Shower Filter removes harmful impurities that cause dryness, irritation, and brittleness. By filtering your shower water, you create the ideal canvas for your skincare routine, helping both your skin and hair stay hydrated and happy. </p><p>Tested to meet NSF water filtration standards, the Qure Shower Filter ensures top safety and quality—so you can enjoy every shower with peace of mind.</p><p><strong> Clinically proven to boost skin & scalp moisture </strong> after just 8 weeks of daily use.</p><p><img src=\"https://qureskincaredns.com/new/assets/upper_arrow.svg\" class=\"me-2\"><span>Boost skin moisture by <strong> 15% </strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://qureskincaredns.com/new/assets/upper_arrow.svg\" class=\"me-2\"><span>Boost scalp moisture by  <strong> 22% </strong></span></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsed_xqBcWj": {
          "type": "collapsed",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How It Works",
            "heading_mobile": "",
            "text": "<p>Our Triple-Filtration System targets up to 99% of chlorine, heavy metals, and contaminants in your water. Here's what happens:</p><ul><li>Water passes through our multi-stage filter</li><li>Impurities get trapped in the specialized filtration media</li><li>Clean, filtered water flows through your shower head</li></ul><p>The result? Water that's gentler on your skin and hair, without the stuff that can strip away natural moisture.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsed_E33cqi": {
          "type": "collapsed",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s Included In The Box",
            "heading_mobile": "",
            "text": "<p>Inside the box, you'll find:</p><ul><li>The Qure Shower Filter with a replaceable filter cartridge (lasts up to 3 months)</li><li>A universal shower head wrench for easy installation</li><li>Clear setup instructions that won't leave you scratching your head</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
